"""Specific reasons for each original scenario and worked-example distractor.
Order follows the published options after rotation, excluding the correct choice.
"""
REASONS={}
def add(key,s1,s2,d1,d2):REASONS[key]={'scenario':[s1,s2],'worked-diagnostic':[d1,d2]}
add('B01','A user request does not expand the release allowlist or grant refund authority.','Model confidence is not a named reviewer’s bound approval.','Set intersection checks supplied names; it does not infer intent from arbitrary language.','An allowed draft operation can still lack supporting policy evidence.')
add('B02','Global installation hides undeclared environment assumptions instead of testing isolation.','Copying a home folder imports machine-specific files and potentially credentials without defining setup.','Stable path resolution does not determine which policy answers a question.','The example uses the current interpreter; a fresh environment is a separate check.')
add('B03','The case influenced the fix even though its wording stayed unchanged.','Deleting errors changes the denominator and hides evidence rather than preserving split history.','Paraphrases can preserve the same decision and leak across splits.','Errors remain useful development evidence; deletion does not create a fresh holdout.')
add('B04','A real citation ID can be attached to a claim that contradicts its passage.','JSON syntax and types say nothing about whether an exception exists in the source.','Rejecting an extra key does not inspect stored ownership of cited records.','Exact fields constrain shape, not factual entailment.')
add('B05','Switching providers silently introduces an unapproved data destination and may retain the same permission problem.','Repeated requests cannot repair a permanent permission denial and can exhaust the budget.','Request time already consumed part of the total deadline; it cannot be ignored.','Resetting the timer permits total elapsed work to exceed the declared maximum.')
add('B06','Removing the exception changes the policy meaning even if the retained sentence sounds positive.','Dropping source identity destroys traceability rather than fixing evidence selection.','The output reserve is reserved; using it for retrieval can truncate the response.','Exceptions are part of the rule and cannot be removed merely to fit.')
add('B07','Mixing contradictory versions without effective scope delegates policy authority to the model.','Erasing history prevents reproducing earlier runs and answering historical queries.','A digest identifies bytes, not source authority or applicability.','Upload time does not determine effective dates or historical policy selection.')
add('B08','More orchestration does not establish that the retriever handles the missing vocabulary.','A lexical miss cannot show that no semantic or normalized retrieval could find evidence.','Chunk size does not establish relevance when all scores are zero.','Choosing the first unrelated passage turns no evidence into a false citation.')
add('B09','Assuming a missing condition can change eligibility and produce an unsupported decision.','A percentage does not supply the missing item condition or approval authority.','The table contains prepared labels for a few fixtures, not a general entailment evaluator.','Different customer scopes can have different applicable policies.')
add('B10','An apology is presentation after the access boundary, not an enforced permission check.','A description guides proposals but cannot stop an unauthorized server lookup.','A shared error hides existence only after actual owner validation.','Authentication establishes actor identity; an indistinguishable error does not replace it.')
add('B11','Invented observations contaminate the state and can produce a false answer.','The model’s declaration cannot override application limits on time and iterations.','A model instruction cannot enforce a server timeout.','A single network step can exceed five seconds; iteration count is not elapsed time.')
add('B12','Approval covers the reviewed payload, not unlimited future edits.','An idempotency key recognizes a retry; it does not grant authorization for changed content.','A dictionary belongs to one process and is not shared atomic coordination.','A hash fingerprints data; it neither claims work atomically nor controls remote delivery.')
add('B13','Valid JSON can still contain a forged owner field.','Identity and authority belong to server authentication, not model judgment.','Serialization returns data; it does not insert a durable row.','A failure response does not imply a worker or successful persistence exists.')
add('B14','User behavior cannot enforce a database invariant under concurrent requests.','Both requests can pass an application check before either inserts.','Database rollback cannot reverse an external email already sent.','Writes in the same transaction commit together or roll back together.')
add('B15','Endless loading hides failure and gives no recovery path.','Sending a request is not confirmation that generation or save completed.','A data structure cannot demonstrate focus, keyboard control or status interpretation.','A brighter button does not establish correct labels or recoverable input.')
add('B16','The average hides a systematic failure in a consequential category.','Removing difficult cases changes the workload instead of fixing the regression.','Exact comparison itself is already established; semantic support is the missing evidence.','Counting categories is mechanical and cannot assess factual claims.')
add('B17','A model promise is not enforcement against unauthorized actions or reads.','Administrator language in a document does not grant server authority.','A few proposal tests cannot enumerate every logging or output disclosure channel.','Model susceptibility depends on actual model/input behavior, which this enforcement fixture does not test.')
add('B18','Elapsed work does not turn an unavailable answer into a successful outcome.','Dropping failed runs hides reliability and tail behavior.','Four synthetic runs cannot establish future production latency.','Milliseconds measure time; they are not observed provider cost or usage.')
add('B19','Browsers need an HTTP API, not private database access or credentials.','A container filesystem path is not a browser HTTP origin.','Docker service DNS is available inside the network, not automatically to the browser.','PostgreSQL stores records; Nginx and the API serve the browser workflow.')
add('B20','Frontend restart cannot reconstruct deleted database data or schema.','Application image layers do not contain the live database’s previous rows.','Backup validity changes with corruption, compatibility and recovery procedures; it must be tested.','Deleting the source before verified isolated restore introduces avoidable data loss.')
add('B21','In-memory personas lose state on process replacement and do not validate approval transitions.','A larger context window is not a persistent checkpoint store.','The job remains; its state/version no longer match the old UPDATE predicate.','The transition was controlled by database state, not another agent’s approval.')
add('B22','Image quality adds no observation of saved state across a restart.','A component variable disappears when the application state is recreated.','Local functions do not exercise HTTP authentication, browser rendering or actual storage wiring.','A source screenshot describes code but does not observe the integrated path.')
add('B23','Deleting the counterexample hides the defect and changes evaluation population.','A new screenshot cannot correct source-revision selection.','The case remains valuable as a regression even after losing holdout status.','The implementation used the case to tune, so unchanged labels do not preserve independence.')
add('B24','Synthetic cases and a fake provider do not establish universal autonomous reliability.','A partial offline result is not an external production certification.','Hashes identify bytes; missing instructions are still missing.','Production readiness requires operational and quality evidence beyond an intact manifest.')
add('W01','A common currency is still an invention when the source does not establish it.','Zero is not a currency and cannot represent unknown currency faithfully.','First occurrence does not establish whether an amendment supersedes it.','A matching span is evidence of text, not approval of a purchase.')
add('W02','Changing quantity to repair arithmetic falsifies a source value.','Model preference is not a documented resolution of conflicting source arithmetic.','Schema failure calls for review or correction against evidence, not an invented quantity.','Decimal can represent one; the problem is boolean type, not decimal arithmetic.')
add('W03','Correct low-risk fields do not cancel an incorrect critical account reference.','Record acceptance is a separate gate from average field correctness.','Four is the total-attempt denominator; the question asks about two accepted records.','Reviewing a different record does not undo a wrong accepted record.')
add('W04','A name in a suggestion is not evidence that the person accepted.','Organizing a meeting does not make someone owner of every proposed task.','The reviewer’s current date may differ from the meeting context.','Guessing a weekday without the stated reference and convention fabricates precision.')
add('W05','Deleting the prior correction destroys history rather than resolving a version conflict.','Last-write-wins silently overwrites work based on stale state.','Approval binds reviewed content, not future changes.','Stable action identity does not mean owner/date/content stayed the same.')
add('W06','Removing a prerequisite changes operational permission, not merely style.','Mentioning publication does not preserve the legal-review blocker.','Identity reconciliation cannot authorize an unsupported action.','Matching paraphrases requires transcript evidence; it does not remove the review duty.')
add('W07','Selecting only favorable evidence conceals the operational limitation.','Averaging incompatible claims cannot resolve version or mode scope.','Marketing does not establish a missing permission/license term.','Successful execution is separate from documented permitted use.')
add('W08','A primary source supports what it actually states, not every favorable comparison.','Local processing is a deployment property, not comparative accuracy evidence.','Existing IDs do not replace comparable testing for a comparative assertion.','A scoped record cannot establish a claim in every environment.')
add('W09','Excluding failures changes the planned workload and biases the comparison.','No output is not a fast correct result; timing and correctness must stay separate.','The failed run has an actual outcome; zero-time substitution is invented data.','Making both candidates look successful removes the evidence the decision needs.')
add('W10','Politeness does not reduce the consequence of account compromise.','Punctuation is not a reliable operational severity rule.','Set operations act on supplied tags; they do not infer meaning from arbitrary text.','A polite compromise report remains urgent under the stated consequence policy.')
add('W11','An undocumented nearest-label guess loses the invalid-output observation.','A classifier output cannot create an authorized refund operation.','Absent review support says nothing that forces other classes’ precision to zero.','No expected cases leaves a zero denominator, not proof of perfect recall.')
add('W12','Duplicate delivery should not create two independently actionable copies of the same work.','At least one received original must remain; deleting both loses work.','Discarding originals hides the content conflict and destroys recovery evidence.','New content under an old ID does not automatically establish a reviewed topic.')
add('W13','A plausible number without source evidence is still fabricated.','Another company’s endorsement does not describe this product or provide publication permission.','A valid ID does not prove the sentence faithfully uses its contents.','Style directions cannot authorize invented facts.')
add('W14','Hiding references makes a claim harder to audit rather than better supported.','Reviewer confidence does not add a feature to the approved fact sheet.','An unsupported request remains unsupported even when a critic repeats it.','Round exhaustion is a stopping condition, not factual success.')
add('W15','Topic similarity does not preserve exact approved content or destination.','Publishing first bypasses the approval boundary instead of validating it.','Removing a published artifact can leave the source and audit intact.','Deleting history cannot prove nobody saw the publication.')
add('W16','An impressive integration does not justify abandoning the selected acceptance scenarios.','Removing failure tests hides whether the core workflow is usable.','Writing a plan does not issue browser/API actions.','Labeling a component fake clarifies scope but cannot observe an integration.')
add('W17','Clickability may already work; the missing observation is durable readback.','A heading rendering says nothing about server-side storage.','A helper returning200 is not an HTTP transaction through the real API.','A browser has network, rendering and retained-input behavior absent from sqlite3.')
add('W18','A hero image does not supply the missing fixture or reproducible setup.','The environment may expose a real undocumented dependency; investigate the failure.','An index can contain missing, empty or unsupported evidence paths.','Removing limitations inflates the claim without adding evidence.')
add('F01','Interest is not agreement or budget/data authority.','A friendly contact cannot authorize the full archive by enthusiasm alone.','A larger package cannot resolve absent factual-review capacity.','Reviewer availability is a feasibility gate, not a weighted score to average away.')
add('F02','The examples are evidence that must be reconciled with the statement.','Choosing the favorable frequency biases the benefit case before measurement.','An attractive number is not a consistent observation.','Averaging different definitions hides rather than resolves measurement disagreement.')
add('F03','Ignoring extra review overstates net benefit.','Released minutes may not convert into paid work, and other costs still apply.','An arbitrary rate does not establish avoided cash cost or profit.','Maintenance is an explicit subtraction in the illustrative model.')
add('F04','Scans and external sending add different parsing, authority and failure requirements.','Unresolved assumptions will produce conflicting acceptance expectations.','Misunderstanding a feature does not grant sending authorization.','Sending is outside the agreed local-export scope.')
add('F05','Untested formats cannot inherit text-only acceptance evidence.','Weakening old gates to fit new scope erases the original delivery promise.','A polished demo did not execute the missing scenario.','Absence of an observed failure is not a passed test when no test ran.')
add('F06','Testing, review and handover consume real delivery effort.','Omitted effort still has to be performed or the outcome remains incomplete.','2200 is44×50 before the allowance and cannot include unlimited support.','52.8 is planned effort hours, not guaranteed client profit.')
add('F07','Sharing a sample does not make unrelated hidden personal fields necessary or authorized.','Realistic-looking personal details do not justify unrelated portfolio disclosure.','Exports/backups are separate copies with distinct owners and removal processes.','A log message is a claim, not observation of every retained copy.')
add('F08','Hiding review misrepresents the pilot’s actual operation and authority.','Invented concepts turn source gaps into unsupported teaching output.','A fake workflow test lacks real-model, operations and acceptance evidence for unattended release.','A deterministic fake cannot measure a future model’s factual quality.')
add('F09','A defect restores an existing promise; new languages change the promised capability.','Translation adds factual review and evaluation work beyond cosmetic wording.','An approved requirement needs a recorded decision before removal.','A preference conflict does not prove a reproducible defect against the current promise.')
add('F10','Removing the unsupported case changes the population and hides the blocker.','Twenty synthetic cases cannot guarantee behavior at arbitrary future load or inputs.','Clarification affects completion and reviewer capacity even without a crash.','These scoped outcomes cannot become universal accuracy evidence.')
add('F11','Data access remains a dependency for representative validation despite useful synthetic work.','Code existence does not observe client-data behavior or acceptance.','Synthetic fixtures intentionally cover a chosen subset, not all real data conditions.','Independent implementation can continue while dependent acceptance remains blocked.')
add('F12','The field is only one small part of external effect authority and recovery.','External sending can be misaddressed, duplicated or uncertain; it is not risk-free.','New external effects need additional acceptance cases.','Permission to draft does not authorize distribution or recipients.')
add('F13','Revocation exposing a runtime dependency is a failed ownership separation, not a successful handover.','A stopped service establishes a defect, not absence of future support.','Independent operation was precisely the missing observation.','Sharing personal credentials perpetuates the dependency instead of separating identities.')
add('F14','A screenshot cannot observe scenarios that were never executed.','Attendance records presence, not satisfaction of every requirement.','The assistance must be recorded; attendance does not resolve the usability gap.','Success with every answer supplied is not independent operation.')
add('F15','Unreadable output violates the adapter contract and must not become success.','Upstream repair time is outside a guaranteed instant local fix.','An acknowledgment deadline cannot force a provider outage to end.','Third-party dependencies remain even when a response target is agreed.')
add('F16','A fabricated testimonial adds a false endorsement to the false attribution.','Working software does not make an invented commercial engagement real.','A ten-note observation cannot guarantee future populations or monthly volume.','A synthetic timing comparison does not establish a paying buyer.')
add('F17','Similar business category does not establish an identical internal bottleneck.','Cohorts establish the listed activity, not preparation pain or willingness to change.','The fictional nature of the supplied practice profile is known, not the operational hypothesis.','Mentioning a supplied fact in an unsent draft does not establish the pain hypothesis.')
add('F18','UI polish does not add scan parsing or evaluation evidence.','Deleting the scope statement hides rather than repairs the mismatch.','Renaming does not execute PDF parsing or change the tested inputs.','A screenshot cannot establish the promised unsupported capability.')
assert len(REASONS)==60
